<title>HONG KONG: HK provisional Feb-Apr unemployment 2.6 pct.</title>
<headline>HK provisional Feb-Apr unemployment 2.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Census and Statistics Department gave on Thursday the following seasonally adjusted figures as percentages of the total workforce:</p>
<p>			Feb-Apr*  Jan-Mar   Oct-Dec   Jan-Mar</p>
<p>			 1997	1997	1996	1996</p>
<p> Unemployment	2.6	 2.5	 2.6	 3.2</p>
<p> Underemployment   1.2	 1.1	 1.6	 2.0</p>
<p>* = provisional</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
